      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "JUNIOR CREEK (1) finds it hard to break through. Has been in the minors the last two runs, the latest finishing second (18.67) at Dubbo. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card last start despite being beaten. Must come into calculations. KERT KERT (2) is a capable type and proved too classy last time to win by 1.5 lengths at Dubbo in a handy 18.64 beating Sage Davies. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings two times from three attempts. Sure to measure up. SECRET BULLET (3) was in the minors two back (18.62) at Richmond but ran below best last time there, finishing 7th. The form out of last race has been strong. Has ability and can atone. BILLIE GIRL (8) warrants respect although new to this track.",
